      "source": "Writes type restrictions to the given <code>Document</code>. This usually results in an <code>$in</code>-clause to be\ngenerated that restricts the type-key (e.g. <code>_class</code>) to be in the set of type aliases for the given\n<code>restrictedTypes</code>.",
      "translation": "向给定的 <code>Document</code> 写入类型限制。这通常会导致生成一个 <code>$in</code> 子句，将类型键（例如 <code>_class</code>）限制在给定的 <code>restrictedTypes</code> 中的类型别名集合内。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
